963 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Over the past few weeks\054 we ran three structured workshops with Product\054 Sales\054 and Sales Leadership to evaluate and refine Arrive\031s 2\055year business product vision\056 The goal was to pressure test an end\055to\055end future state experience\054 align on success criteria\054 and prioritize what matters most to deliver customer and business value\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 964 0 R
     /Pg 961 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
