983 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Integrations were seen as essential to making Arrive feel embedded within real customer environments rather than another standalone tool\056 Connecting with expense\054 fleet\054 HRIS\054 and identity systems\054 including SSO for enterprise authentication\054 enables Arrive to operate as part of a broader ecosystem\054 supporting seamless\054 self\055serve data exchange and long\055term adoption\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
