  << /ActualText (We will continue refining the vision and prototype based on this internal alignment\056 The next step is to share the vision with prospective and existing B2B customers to understand how it resonates externally\054 where it creates value\054 and where it needs further refinement\056\n\nThank you again for your contributions\041 Your perspective is shaping the future direction for Arrive\056)
